From 55b06068708c21b13779ad4e9112aeb530e10f19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UN1CA <dev@example.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 13:06:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Exynos9810 HAL3 thumbnail stream configuration failure

The Exynos9810 camera HAL (via the ported UniHAL 2.1 shim's
ScenarioManager) never reports a valid buffer count for any
non-PREVIEW scenario stream, always returning maxBuffers=0. Android's
Camera3Device treats that as fatal ("Function not implemented (-38)"
/ "Unsupported set of inputs/outputs provided"), which fails the
whole capture session and previously caused the Camera app to close
itself before a single preview frame was ever produced.

CamDeviceImpl.d0() still built a THUMBNAIL PictureStreamInfo-based
stream even though it's cosmetic/optional, so this null's it out
before the null-check, matching how h0()/i0() already skip the other
optional (picture/preview-callback) streams. With only the mandatory
PREVIEW stream requested at session-open, configuration succeeds and
the live viewfinder works again.

Known limitation: actual photo/video capture is not fixed by this
patch alone, since h0() already skips creating the picture (JPEG)
ImageReader entirely on this platform (that stream hits the exact
same HAL bug). Fixing capture requires either getting the real HAL
to report a valid buffer count for CAPTURE-scenario streams, or a
capture path that doesn't depend on it.
---
 .../com/samsung/android/camera/core2/device/CamDeviceImpl.smali | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/camera/core2/device/CamDeviceImpl.smali b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/camera/core2/device/CamDeviceImpl.smali
index d61d8f5..de4df6c 100644
--- a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/camera/core2/device/CamDeviceImpl.smali
+++ b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/camera/core2/device/CamDeviceImpl.smali
@@ -3631,6 +3631,8 @@
     :goto_1
     iget-object v1, v1, Lcom/samsung/android/camera/core2/container/SessionConfig;->i:Lcom/samsung/android/camera/core2/container/PictureStreamInfo;
 
+    const/4 v1, 0x0
+
     if-nez v1, :cond_4
 
     invoke-virtual/range {p0 .. p0}, Lcom/samsung/android/camera/core2/device/CamDeviceImpl;->X()V
-- 
2.43.0

